            "value" : "AI 会话文件损坏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 会话文件损坏，本次不会向其写回：%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI session file is corrupted; it will not be written back this time: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 会话文件损坏，本次不会向其写回：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 功能仅在你显式发起请求时，将所选内容发送至你配置的第三方服务；API Key 保存在系统钥匙串。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI features send the selected content to your configured third-party service only when you explicitly request it; API keys are stored in the system Keychain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 功能仅在你显式发起请求时，将所选内容发送至你配置的第三方服务；API Key 保存在系统钥匙串。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 功能会将你选中的文本或文档内容，发送到你自行配置的第三方 AI 服务（OpenAI、DeepSeek、Claude 等）。\n\nMarkPDF 自身不经过任何服务器、不收集遥测；API Key 仅保存在系统钥匙串。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI features send your selected text or document content to the third-party AI service you configure (OpenAI, DeepSeek, Claude, etc.).\n\nMarkPDF itself runs no servers and collects no telemetry; API keys are stored only in the system Keychain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 功能会将你选中的文本或文档内容，发送到你自行配置的第三方 AI 服务（OpenAI、DeepSeek、Claude 等）。\n\nMarkPDF 自身不经过任何服务器、不收集遥测；API Key 仅保存在系统钥匙串。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
